### Create task
POST https://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Prepare demo", "status": "in_progress", "due_date": "2026-12-01T10:00:00+05:30"}

### List tasks
GET https://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tasks?status=todo&due_before=2027-01-01T00:00:00Z

### Update status
PATCH https://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "done"}
